{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "FUCHSIA EXTRAS — Maps 107, 162, 487, 488, 712, 713, 714, 804.",
    "Mixed tone: Safari Zone areas are ecological/conservation-minded.",
    "Creepy House (712-714) is genuinely unsettling — objects that",
    "shouldn't be there, books nobody has read, beds nobody has slept in.",
    "The house is wrong. The player should feel unwelcome.",
    "",
    "Map 107 (Safari Zone Secret House): EV001 gives HM03 Surf.",
    "HM grant mechanics preserved. Flavor intro rewritten to feel",
    "like a ranger outpost, not a game show prize booth.",
    "",
    "Map 162 (Underwater): 'Krrsss!' cries and quest completion",
    "messages are MECHANICAL — fishing quest logic. Preserved exactly.",
    "",
    "Maps 487/488 (Safari Zone Area 5): ALL events are Pokemon cries",
    "('Digdig!', 'Tchrtchr!', 'Shaaash!', etc.) — MECHANICAL.",
    "Preserved exactly.",
    "",
    "Maps 712/713/714 (Creepy House): Books, beds, pictures, dolls,",
    "mirror, room label sign. ALL are flavor text. Dolls have switch",
    "conditions (615, 620, 622-625, var 233) tied to the haunting",
    "mechanic — conditions preserved, text rewritten for dread.",
    "EV019 in 714 is a room label sign (classroom/bathroom/entrance/",
    "library) — MECHANICAL label system, preserved.",
    "EV008 in 714 (mirror) rewritten for horror. EV032 in 713 (ghost",
    "jumpscare 'Boo!') preserved as mechanical event.",
    "EV017 in 714 (Pikachu cry) is MECHANICAL — preserved.",
    "",
    "Map 804 (Safari Zone Gate): Darkness event guards. Flavor",
    "rewritten. Plant-blocked entrance (EV003 page 1) preserved.",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line for RPG Maker XP."
  ],
